$ Point mass at radius 2 with RFORCE angular velocity and angular acceleration in a LOAD combination with S = 2, S1 = 3.
$ The load must be 6 times that of the RFORCE alone. The bug scaled the angular velocity, so the centrifugal part was
$ 36 times. The angular acceleration part was right.
SOL 101
CEND
SPCFORCES = ALL
LOAD = 1
BEGIN BULK
GRID           1       0     0.0     0.0     0.0       0      13
GRID           2       0     2.0     0.0     0.0       0
CELAS2         1   3.0+6       1       1       2       1
CELAS2         2   3.0+6       1       3       2       3
RFORCE         2       0       0     1.5     0.0     1.0     0.0        +
+            1.5
CONM2          2       2       0     7.0
LOAD           1     2.0     3.0       2
ENDDATA
